## Read-only review follow-up

The four initial T07 evidence gaps were corrected in the final implementation:
real owner-readable firm-two extractions and duplicate candidates; complete
numeric metric/activity and web-root capture with positive controls; SQL review
row counts of zero/one/one before finalization, afterward, and after replay;
and binary SQL cell inspection with UTF-8/UTF-16 controls. The full gate above
was rerun after those changes were committed. Test totals and floors are unchanged.
